Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:05:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1438/1463] HERESY 1508-1509: a node's right-click and window
 run the chain up to it or bypass it, the old tab's frame off; no dropdowns in
 a node's window (a select's choices in sight, a long list over the page with
 a filter)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
